   <p style="font-family: var(--font-body); font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--pm-cacao-600); max-width: 46ch; margin: 0 auto 30px;">Start with our Chuncho ceremonial cacao paste or ground cacao, the cleanest, most direct way to experience what cacao can do.</p>
   <div style="display: flex; gap: 14px; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap;">
    <x-import component-from-global-scope="PachaManaDesignSystem_9805b9.Button" variant="primary" size="lg">Shop Chuncho Cacao</x-import>
    <x-import component-from-global-scope="PachaManaDesignSystem_9805b9.Button" variant="outline" size="lg">Explore The Guide</x-import>
   </div>
   <p style="font-family: var(--font-body); font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--pm-cacao-600); margin: 22px 0 0;">Or <a href="/shop" style="color: var(--pm-cacao-700); text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px;">shop Pacha Mana ceremonial cacao</a> and choose the format that fits your morning.</p>
  </div>
